  "blocks": [
    {
      "id": "answer",
      "kind": "markdown",
      "text": "演示数据，不是真实业务结果。全量 baseline 200 → current 150，净变化 -50；变化率为 -25%，分母是 baseline 全量 200。A、B 的减少量合计 80，其他项 C 增加 30，抵消后净减少 50。这里是观测值的贡献分解，没有解释变化原因的证据。"
    },
    {
      "id": "net-change",
      "kind": "metric",
      "datasetId": "summary",
      "columnId": "current",
      "rowIndex": 0,
      "label": "全量当前值",
      "comparisons": [
        {
          "label": "较基准",
          "referenceColumnId": "baseline",
          "deltaColumnId": "delta_current_minus_baseline",
          "sentiment": "neutral"
        }
      ]
    },
    {
      "id": "selection",
      "kind": "markdown",
      "text": "## 按减少量降序选取 Top 2\n从完整三项按 baseline - current 降序预选 A、B。图展示的是反向命名明确的减少量，不是全量净变化。writer 收到两行，rowCount = 2、truncated = false；这不表示未做预选。80 / 50 = 160% 是局部减少量与全量净减少的比值，不能称为覆盖率。"
    },
    {
      "id": "selected-decreases",
      "kind": "chart",
      "datasetId": "selected",
      "chart": "bar",
      "x": "category",
      "y": ["decrease_baseline_minus_current"],
      "numericMode": "exact"
    },
    {
      "id": "reconciliation",
      "kind": "markdown",
      "text": "## 全量与余项核对\n下面各表的 delta 均为 current - baseline。选中项 -80 + 其他项 +30 = 全量 -50；保留其他项的净贡献，不能将选中项的减少量 80 写成全量净减少。"
    },
    {
      "id": "scope-values",
      "kind": "table",
      "datasetId": "summary",
      "columns": ["scope", "baseline", "current", "delta_current_minus_baseline"]
    },
    {
      "id": "all-values",
      "kind": "table",
      "datasetId": "full",
      "columns": ["category", "baseline", "current", "delta_current_minus_baseline"]
    }
  ],
